## 1. Final architecture

```text
                         Internet
                            │
                            ▼
                    GCP Load Balancer
                            │
                            ▼
                      GKE Ingress
                            │
              ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
              │             │             │
              ▼             ▼             ▼
        user-service  product-service  order-service
              │             │             │
          ClusterIP      ClusterIP      ClusterIP
              │             │             │
            Pods          Pods           Pods
              ▲             ▲             │
              │             │             │
              └─────────────┴─────────────┘
                             │
                     HTTP Service Calls
```

The important communication is:

```text
order-service
     │
     ├── HTTP → http://user-service:3000
     │
     └── HTTP → http://product-service:3000
```

