# 17. Add Ingress

Once internal communication works, expose the API.

Create:

`k8s/ingress/ingress.yaml`

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress

metadata:
  name: microservices-ingress

spec:
  rules:
    - http:

        paths:

          - path: /users
            pathType: Prefix

            backend:
              service:
                name: user-service
                port:
                  number: 3000

          - path: /products
            pathType: Prefix

            backend:
              service:
                name: product-service
                port:
                  number: 3000

          - path: /orders
            pathType: Prefix

            backend:
              service:
                name: order-service
                port:
                  number: 3000
```

Apply:

```bash
kubectl apply -f k8s/ingress/ingress.yaml
```

Check:

```bash
kubectl get ingress
```

GKE will provision a Google Cloud Load Balancer.

